@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5005
@photoId = replace-with-an-id-returned-by-upload

### Register (use your HTTP client's cookie jar for subsequent requests)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Schlawgs-Request: 1

{"username":"my_dog_account","password":"replace-with-your-password"}

### Current account
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

### Upload (change the path to a real image)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/photos
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=PhotoBoundary
X-Schlawgs-Request: 1

--PhotoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="dog.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./dog.png
--PhotoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="descriptions"

A good day at the park.
--PhotoBoundary--

### List photo metadata
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/photos

### Edit your description
PATCH {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/photos/{{photoId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Schlawgs-Request: 1

{"description":"The best day at the park."}

### Download one photo
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/photos/{{photoId}}
